1028
01:03:06,834 --> 01:03:11,083
♪ Yes, won't someone ♪

1029
01:03:11,083 --> 01:03:14,458
♪ Please have
a little pity? ♪

1030
01:03:16,792 --> 01:03:19,417
♪ Now don't you
ee-spiddly-doo ♪

1031
01:03:19,417 --> 01:03:21,125
♪ Ee-doo-you-blue ♪

1032
01:03:21,125 --> 01:03:24,000
♪ Then I won't
